# Build output
Flashback-Redroided-*.zip

# Java
*.class

# NOTE: *.jar is deliberately NOT ignored.
# deps/ and ffmpeg/ ship jars that build.gradle references via
# `shadow files(...)`, so they must stay tracked or a fresh clone
# cannot build. gradle-wrapper.jar is tracked by convention.

